  "hints": [
    "Parallel branch currents add up at the supply. With 330 Ω each takes about 21 mA, so 63 mA in all.",
    "You need each branch under 15 mA (3 × 15 = 45) but over 10 mA. Which resistor gives 10–15 mA from 7 V?",
    "560 Ω gives 12.5 mA (37 mA in all). 470 Ω just fits too (44 mA). 820 Ω is too dim."
