  "debrief": "A supply has a limit, and every branch takes its share: the total is the sum of the branches. Here 3 × 12.5 mA = 37.5 mA, which is 9 V × 37.5 mA = 0.34 W. Battery gadgets are designed exactly like this: add up every current, check it against the battery or adapter, and trim the brightness until it fits."
